     1,
     "<div>You can find code for how to constrain standardized effects in an RI-CLPM here (under Extension 1, you will see three tabs, one is for standardized constrained effects):</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://jeroendmulder.github.io/RI-CLPM/lavaan.html#The_RI-CLPM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://jeroendmulder.github.io/RI-CLPM/lavaan.html%23The_RI-CLPM&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414739770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ppBkdsJJ1brNBtFempGjC\">https://jeroendmulder.github.io/RI-CLPM/lavaan.html#The_RI-CLPM</a></div>"
